s including inflation, trade disputes, or reduced technology spending may adversely impact our business.","context":"•We have a history of losses and may not achieve profitability in the future.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":485,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"bc6a12a7335fdb39a8dc03a308f32c1bf4848a713fe33d7b8e037a65af4d63d9","quote":"•We have and may continue to expand our business through acquisitions, which may result in unexpected risks and challenges to complete and integrate.","context":"•Adverse economic conditions including inflation, trade disputes, or reduced technology spending may adversely impact our business.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":486,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"68d30a49f35a3ad69c8a9eb7d0529e72ccb2544c61c7a787619edca259ac2c25","quote":"•Because we recognize revenue from subscriptions for our platform over the term of the subscription, downturns or upturns in new business may not be immediately reflected in our operating results.","context":"•We have and may continue to expand our business through acquisitions, which may result in unexpected risks and challenges to complete and integrate.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":487,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"06a072450a0a450069cfd1bb29e97448e7747b27e18638d49e4806ab6e10ee2e","quote":"•Our business has evolved, which makes it difficult to predict our future operating results.","context":"•Because we recognize revenue from subscriptions for our platform over the term of the subscription, downturns or upturns in new business may not be immediately reflected in our operating results.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":488,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"eed79ff2c81b90289092a44e8bae1e376b7a1427fe742cdb0c5eb185b1b04ea3","quote":"•We have experienced significant changes to our organization and structure and may not be able to effectively manage such changes.","context":"•Our business has evolved, which makes it difficult to predict our future operating results.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":489,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"93fc84e93f01f00dec8c34e18659c61e66428f97fb1899e2004353a40f1227c2","quote":"•Failure to adequately manage our sales force will impede our growth.","context":"•We have experienced significant changes to our organization and structure and may not be able to effectively manage such changes.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":490,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"fc070b99ede2ef91e3d2171a7455a86a4fe1332172912c0e376ef3583d794c57","quote":"•We have significant international operations, which exposes us to risk.","context":"•Failure to adequately manage our sales force will impede our growth.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":491,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1