ls could adversely affect our operating results.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":494,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"3e4d8fdbaf62c530f82f3f09aecec216e6c99093a7c887102adafd962116a16f","quote":"•Our platform faces competition in the marketplace. If we are unable to compete effectively, our operating results could be adversely affected.","context":"•Our success depends on a fragmented internet environment for finding information, particularly information about businesses.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":495,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"090b2b4cc934d194778dabb50cf22c4ebf8e23cbbdcfd9739818472191a28d13","quote":"•Business and professional service providers may not widely adopt our platform to manage their information or as an important part of their marketing strategy, which would limit our ability to grow our business.","context":"•Our platform faces competition in the marketplace. If we are unable to compete effectively, our operating results could be adversely affected.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":496,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"2b2f648e549e94673edc523c3d6501da9d5c06140a4a50048fd8712a1e22633a","quote":"•If customers do not renew their subscriptions for our platform or if they reduce their subscriptions at the time of renewal, our revenue will decline and our business will suffer.","context":"•Business and professional service providers may not widely adopt our platform to manage their information or as an important part of their marketing strategy, which would limit our ability to grow our business.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":497,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"bfc1bf6c72577fe21eb6c4c8ff58ad985595ff7e3bf34524ba238c840cc1fa84","quote":"•If we are unable to attract new customers, our revenue growth could be slower than we expect and our business may be harmed.","context":"•If customers do not renew their subscriptions for our platform or if they reduce their subscriptions at the time of renewal, our revenue will decline and our business will suffer.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":498,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"d7470907bd81f9bbf49d0b1f6812d6a358a4d85f9fc6f606be651bb618d27cf3","quote":"•If we fail to integrate our platform with a variety of third-party technologies, our platform may become less marketable and less competitive or obsolete and our operating results would be harmed.","context":"•If we are unable to attract new customers, our revenue growth could be slower than we expect and our business may be harmed.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":499,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"4088e4b9d83ad61a14066a363e1d36ca5b392276c1ebdc987bc50c8cb869fb25","quote":"•If we are unable to successfully develop and market new features, make enhancements to our existing features, or expand our offerings into new markets, our business, results of operations and competitive position may suffer.","context":"42","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":501,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"e74b6179d35c55bff0047930f8cd4722d978309939fb00e9d26d65aabad7d493","quote":"•If we fail to adapt and respond effectively to rapidly changing technology, evolving industry standards and changing customer needs or requirements, our platform may become less competitive.","context":"•If we are unable to successfully develop and market new features, make enhancements to our existing features, or expand our offerings into new markets, our business, results of operations and competitive position may suffer.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":502,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"0b40d930f14791a770877bf93ae978da24d098ad80eccaf72019de82609415ee","quote":"•If customers do not expand their use of our platform beyond their current subscriptions and licenses, our ability to grow our business and operating results may be adversely affected.","context":"•If we fail to adapt and respond effectively to rapidly changing technology, evolving industry standards and changing customer needs or requirements, our platform may become less competitive.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":503,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"6a13deed398872f948533af9a62e9733003f45596038de43da9fe6e9c3c89f9b","quote":"•Because our platform is sold to enterprises that often have complex operating environments, we may encounter long and unpredictable sales cycles, which could adversely affect our operating results in any given period.","context":"•If customers do not expand their use of our platform beyond their current subscriptions and licenses, our ability to grow our business and operating results may be adversely affected.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":504,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"1f1b86b452d9ed023c3b22c5b8c5869ab2038546f9ca8b257495280a07971513","quote":"•A portion of our revenue is dependent on a few customers.","context":"•Because our platform is sold to enterprises that often have complex operating environments, we may encounter long and unpredictable sales cycles, which could adversely affect our operating results in any given period.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":505,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"456909da1a95fbe214d0932301afcf0cf2465296001e7793c4933d760b968937","quote":"•A significant portion of our revenue is dependent on third-party reseller customers, the efforts of which we do not control.","context":"•A portion of our revenue is dependent on a few customers.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":506,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"5b80f6777280d0008a287e48b621af389418d10408016e547686514c2b015716","quote":"•We may require additional capital to support our business, and this capital might not be available on acceptable terms, if at all.","context":"•A significant portion of our revenue is dependent on third-party reseller customers, the efforts of which we do not control.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":507,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"d5435bdf432b5d8b1e4562cef07b9d1ba7a5723e47cfb1f39be002dab878c456","quote":"•Our capital allocation strategy, including our recently completed self-tender offer, may not be effective at enhancing stockholder value, or providing other benefits we expect.","context":"•We may require additional capital to support our business, and this capital might not be available on acceptable terms, if at all.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":508,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"caf8d63970d5e86c8405fb9c902d59c7a2b33991e8abca553b74923bffd6a5cf","quote":"Risks Related to Information Technology, Intellectual Property, and Data Security","context":"•Our capital allocation strategy, including our recently completed self-tender offer, may not be effective at enhancing stockholder value, or providing other benefits we expect.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":509,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"b33c469a66cba93a5de2af13c684fed91a4144b9ac8f13ea837605b5d463cd6c","quote":"•A security breach, network attack or security incident could delay or interrupt service to our customers, result in the unauthorized access to, or use, modification or publishing of customer content or other information, harm our reputation or subject us to significant liability.","context":"Risks Related to Information Technology, Intellectual Property, and Data Security","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":510,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"44cd3b3454dc39683decb647ea1b476c3ec3aa111533bbcf182fba28bc8a9dd4","quote":"•Assertions by third parties of infringement or other violations by us of their intellectual property rights could result in significant costs and harm our business and operating results.","context":"•A security breach, network attack or security incident could delay or interrupt service to our customers, result in the unauthorized access to, or use, modification or publishing of customer content or other information, harm our reputation or subject us to significant liability.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":511,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"345f4594c51bc3286603d6df1f2b794f38cc3c51a7a2ee3dc91492a21dd06d1c","quote":"•We could incur substantial costs in protecting or defending our intellectual property rights, and any failure to protect our intellectual property could adversely affect our business, results of operations and financial condition.","context":"•Assertions by third parties of infringement or other violations by us of their intellectual property rights could result in significant costs and harm our business and operating results.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":512,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"2aa8bbf0bfd24adc68c1e0fe1f39765749050440306e95fb9fee7810194354bc","quote":"•Our platform utilizes open source software, and any failure to comply with the terms of one or more of these open source licenses could negatively affect our business.","context":"•We could incur substantial costs in protecting or defending our intellectual property rights, and any failure to protect our intellectual property could adversely affect our business, results of operations and financial condition.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":513,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"7275b48dcdd1cbd910760dab82d98de0d7785ff48ecabc9766de87928276b053","quote":"•We employ third-party licensed software for use in or with our platform, and the inability to maintain these licenses or errors in the software we license could result in increased costs, or reduced service levels, which could adversely affect our business.","context":"•Our platform utilizes open source software, and any failure to comply with the terms of one or more of these open source licenses could negatively affect our business.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":514,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31","cik":"0001614178","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1614178/000162828026059784/yext-20260731.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4.bin","sha256":"cafe2bcceb2559fd92a15c40efd1d1d7c4ddf673ea509ff79e7742eabc7f52e4"}},{"id":"20a8bb89b9e2f545c7ae4991a2f2814c718ecaf20757128177a45662564951c3","quote":"•The reliability of our network and support infrastructure will be critical to our success. Sustained failures or outages could lead to significant costs and service disruptions, which could negatively affect our business, financial results and reputation.","context":"•We employ third-party licensed software for use in or with our platform, and the inability to maintain these licenses or errors in the software we license could result in increased costs, or reduced service levels, which could adversely affect our business.","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors","block":515,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001628280-26-059784","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-01","reportDate":"2026-07-31",